-- title:
--   Two V-digits of a Pi=V vector satisfy I⊆ I²
-- statement:
--   Fix a prime $p$, a commutative ring $B$ and a ring homomorphism $j$ from $W(\mathbb{F}_{p^2})$, the $p$-typical Witt vectors of the field `GaloisField p 2`, to $B$, and let $D$ be a graded Cartier module datum of type `GradedCartierModuleData p B j`: a module $M$ over $W(B)$ equipped with additive endomorphisms $F$ (`frobenius`) and $V$ (`verschiebung`), a $W(B)$-linear endomorphism $\Pi$ (`varpi`) and two $W(B)$-submodules `piece 0`, `piece 1` forming a complementary pair, subject to the usual semilinearity and commutation axioms ($F(w\cdot x)=F(w)\cdot F(x)$, $w\cdot V x = V(F(w)\cdot x)$, $V(w\cdot F x)=V(w)\cdot x$, $F V = p$, $\Pi V = V\Pi$, $\Pi F = F\Pi$, $\Pi^2 = p$) and with $V$, $F$, $\Pi$ shifting `piece i` into `piece (i+1)`. Let $\gamma : \mathrm{Fin}\,2 \to M$ be a homogeneous $V$-basis, i.e. $\gamma_i \in \mathrm{piece}\,i$ for both $i$ and every $x\in M$ is uniquely of the form $\sum_i [c_i]\cdot\gamma_i + V y$ with $c \in B^{2}$, $y \in M$, where $[\,\cdot\,]$ denotes the Teichmüller lift `WittVector.teichmuller p`. Fix $i \in \mathrm{Fin}\,2$, elements $x_i, x_{\mathrm{next}} \in M$ and $a \in B$ such that $\Pi \gamma_i = V x_i$ and $\Pi\gamma_{i+1} = [a]\cdot\gamma_i + V x_{\mathrm{next}}$. Then for every $m \in \mathrm{piece}\,i$ with $\Pi m = V m$ there exist $c, d \in B$ and $m_2 \in M$ with $m = [c]\cdot\gamma_i + V\bigl([d]\cdot\gamma_{i+1} + V m_2\bigr)$, and, writing $I = (c,d)$ for the ideal of $B$ generated by $c$ and $d$, one has $c - a d \in I^2$ and $d \in I^2$.
--
--   This is the digit computation of Boutot–Carayol at a critical index: for a vector fixed by $\Pi = V$ in the $i$-th graded piece, the ideal generated by its first two Teichmüller digits $c, d$ relative to a homogeneous $V$-basis satisfies $I \subseteq I^2$, since $c \equiv a d$ and $d \equiv 0$ modulo $I^2$. It is used in the study of rigidified special formal modules, where it feeds the two statements [`CerednikDrinfeld.SpecialFormal.Rigidified.exists_smul_eq_nMap_of_nMap_eq_smul_of_isReduced_of_varpi_eq_verschiebung`](thm.html#CerednikDrinfeld.SpecialFormal.Rigidified.exists_smul_eq_nMap_of_nMap_eq_smul_of_isReduced_of_varpi_eq_verschiebung) and [`CerednikDrinfeld.SpecialFormal.Rigidified.exists_smul_eq_nMap_of_nsmul_eq_lambda_of_varpi_eq_teichmuller_smul_add_verschiebung`](thm.html#CerednikDrinfeld.SpecialFormal.Rigidified.exists_smul_eq_nMap_of_nsmul_eq_lambda_of_varpi_eq_teichmuller_smul_add_verschiebung).
